      "pronunciationText": "Two fifty-eight is eight grams above the mean, and two forty-two is eight grams below. The curve is symmetric, so the right tail has the same area: zero point zero five four eight. The middle is one minus two lots of zero point zero five four eight, which is zero point eight nine zero four. One minus zero point zero five four eight is wrong. That removes only the left tail."
